    "## 10. Pairwise Similarity Ordering (Highest to Lowest)\n",
    "\n",
    "This section computes pairwise Tanimoto similarity for all molecules in each set, then orders molecules so the strongest overall matches appear on the left and decrease to the right."
   ]
